Read `.agent/private/README.md` and follow it. It is the single definition of this repo's agent
conventions (artifact naming, append-only lifecycle, provenance labels, what is tracked,
what is never committed) and is shared with every other agent working here — Cursor,
CodeBuddy, Qwen, Qoder.

Do not restate those rules here or in any other rule file, and do not create a second
copy in this tool's own memory/plans directory: copies drift. This file is a pointer only.

Before the final reply of any feature or bugfix, write or append the handoff per
`.agent/private/HANDOFF.md`. Never put Wi-Fi passwords, web tokens, or bench credentials in
tracked files.
